
# -------------------------
# System setup
# -------------------------

read_data       ${fdata_in}
read_data       in.data
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (0 0 -0.5) to (74.824595 64.8 0.5)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
